{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55967","headline":"赠藴上人 · 王正己","name":"赠藴上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佛法诗名更谁继，未闻随分谒侯王。\n洗盂秋涧日华动，捣药夜堂云气香。\n苔藓乱青封叠石，杉松浓影过空墙。\n若非火岳□□地，那得吾师住久长。\n（周本淳校点本《诗话总龟》卷二八引《雅言系述》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王正己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}